window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-014-eb461e35069301d5.json"]={sha256:"eb461e35069301d591cc4685f2ebdd1d348ba1b04f3cf6f6bc8c635f29994337",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-2f38936396021379","url":"https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning/en/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice/running-quantum-circuits","title":"Running quantum circuits","titleEn":"Running quantum circuits","publisher":"IBM Quantum","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-014","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-014","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-015","referenceUrls":["https://doi.org/10.1103/PRXQuantum.2.040204"],"title":"超導讀出工程：Purcell 衰減與濾波取捨","titleEn":"Superconducting readout engineering: Purcell decay and filtering","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付色散近似有效區、符號慣例與待補的非諧性資料。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver a dispersive-validity region, sign convention and missing anharmonicity data. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『超導讀出工程：Purcell 衰減與濾波取捨』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付衰減率帳、2π單位核對與讀出／壽命取捨圖。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Superconducting readout engineering: Purcell decay and filtering', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver a decay-rate ledger,2π unit check and readout/lifetime tradeoff plot.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：兩能階近似χ=g²/Δ，以循環頻率一致代入可得χ/2π；真實transmon還含非諧性修正。 使用合成g/2π=50 MHz、Δ/2π=1000 MHz；abs(g/Δ)=0.05。 以手算或試算表計算名義式50**2/1000，另開一欄執行獨立核對：檢查χΔ=g²在兩組相同；另把Δ改50 MHz，標記近似失效而非接受巨大位移。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：單模弱耦合代理ΓP=(g/Δ)²κ，κ是能量衰減率s⁻¹，TP=1/ΓP；此處不含濾波器頻率響應。 使用教學g/Δ=0.05、κ=2π×1 MHz；求TP以μs表示。 以手算或試算表計算名義式1/((0.05)**2*2*pi*1e6)*1e6，另開一欄執行獨立核對：驗證比例減半使衰減率四分之一、壽命四倍；確認κ不是直接1 MHz。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Two-level approximation χ=g²/Δ yields χ/2π when cyclic frequencies are used consistently; real transmons require anharmonicity corrections. Use Synthetic g/2π=50 MHz and Δ/2π=1000 MHz give abs(g/Δ)=0.05. Evaluate nominal expression 50**2/1000 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check χΔ=g² in both cases; set Δ=50 MHz separately and flag approximation failure rather than accepting a large shift.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Single-mode weak-coupling proxy ΓP=(g/Δ)²κ uses energy-decay rate κ in s⁻¹, with TP=1/ΓP; filter response is omitted. Use Teaching g/Δ=0.05 and κ=2π×1 MHz; express TP in μs. Evaluate nominal expression 1/((0.05)**2*2*pi*1e6)*1e6 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Verify halving the ratio quarters decay rate and quadruples lifetime; ensure κ was not mistaken for1 MHz.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-024","referenceUrls":["https://research.ibm.com/publications/a-cryo-cmos-control-system-for-large-scale-superconducting-qubit-quantum-computing-part-2"],"title":"IBM Heron 控制鏈：取樣時鐘抖動與相位","titleEn":"IBM Heron control chain: sample-clock jitter and phase","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付色散近似有效區、符號慣例與待補的非諧性資料。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver a dispersive-validity region, sign convention and missing anharmonicity data. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『IBM Heron 控制鏈：取樣時鐘抖動與相位』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付秒／週期／角度換算鏈與固定延遲／隨機抖動分類。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'IBM Heron control chain: sample-clock jitter and phase', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver time/cycle/angle conversions and fixed-delay/random-jitter classification.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：兩能階近似χ=g²/Δ，以循環頻率一致代入可得χ/2π；真實transmon還含非諧性修正。 使用合成g/2π=50 MHz、Δ/2π=1000 MHz；abs(g/Δ)=0.05。 以手算或試算表計算名義式50**2/1000，另開一欄執行獨立核對：檢查χΔ=g²在兩組相同；另把Δ改50 MHz，標記近似失效而非接受巨大位移。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：小時間抖動σt造成相位RMS σφ=2πfσt；只描述參考頻率上的小訊號抖動，不是總門誤差。 使用教學載波f=5 GHz、σt=1 ps；相位以rad量化。 以手算或試算表計算名義式2*pi*5e9*1e-12，另開一欄執行獨立核對：直接計算fσt的週期比例再乘360°；兩種路徑的角度應一致。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Two-level approximation χ=g²/Δ yields χ/2π when cyclic frequencies are used consistently; real transmons require anharmonicity corrections. Use Synthetic g/2π=50 MHz and Δ/2π=1000 MHz give abs(g/Δ)=0.05. Evaluate nominal expression 50**2/1000 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check χΔ=g² in both cases; set Δ=50 MHz separately and flag approximation failure rather than accepting a large shift.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Small timing jitter σt gives RMS phase σφ=2πfσt; this is a small-signal clock contribution, not total gate error. Use Teaching carrier f=5 GHz and σt=1 ps; express phase in rad. Evaluate nominal expression 2*pi*5e9*1e-12 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Compute fractional cycle fσt then multiply by360°; both calculation routes should agree.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-a3054099b553bbb6","url":"https://doi.org/10.1103/PRXQuantum.2.040204","title":"Superconducting Circuit Companion—an Introduction with Worked Examples","titleEn":"Superconducting Circuit Companion—an Introduction with Worked Examples","publisher":"Rasmussen et al., PRX Quantum","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-e29b871843904d5c","url":"https://research.ibm.com/publications/a-cryo-cmos-control-system-for-large-scale-superconducting-qubit-quantum-computing-part-2","title":"A Cryo-CMOS Control System for Large-Scale Superconducting Qubit Quantum Computing: Part 2","titleEn":"A Cryo-CMOS Control System for Large-Scale Superconducting Qubit Quantum Computing: Part 2","publisher":"IBM Research","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
